    <element form="multiline" name="Comments" read-only="false">Data-prep workflow v3 for Beyond the Road Toll. Replaces processing/clean_data.py, supplementary_data.py and phase2_ideas.py: every CSV they write to data/clean is produced here with standard KNIME nodes (no scripting nodes). Raw workbooks are bundled in data/; outputs are written to the workflow data area (data/).</element>
